 "9", "stage": "Days of Hajj", "date": "15 May", "hijri": "9 Zil Hajj", "stay": "Arafat (Wuquf) — air-conditioned marquee, then night in Muzdalifah"}, {"day": "10", "stage": "Days of Hajj", "date": "16 May", "hijri": "10 Zil Hajj", "stay": "Mina (Eid · Rami · Qurbani) — Maktab A tent, Zone 1 near Jamarat"}, {"day": "11", "stage": "Days of Hajj", "date": "17 May", "hijri": "11 Zil Hajj", "stay": "Mina (Rami) — Maktab A tent, Zone 1 near Jamarat"}, {"day": "12", "stage": "In Makkah", "date": "18 May", "hijri": "12 Zil Hajj", "stay": "Your chosen 5-star Makkah hotel"}, {"day": "13", "stage": "Departure", "date": "19 May", "hijri": "13 Zil Hajj", "stay": "Departure to airport"}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['Meet & assist at the airport (Jeddah / Madinah Hajj Terminal)', 'Group airport transfers to hotel (by Naqaba / Saudi Moallim)', 'Makkah hotel accommodation, half-board (breakfast & dinner)', 'Madinah hotel accommodation, half-board (breakfast & dinner)', 'Full-board buffet meals in Mina (8-12 Zil Hajj)', 'Room retained in Makkah during the 5 days of Hajj', 'Maktab A-Category tent in Mina, Zone 1 near Jamarat (avg 16/tent, sofa-cum-bed 50-55cm, private toilet)', 'Air-conditioned tent in Arafat with meals & hot/cold drinks', 'Floor mat & snack box in Muzdalifah', 'Private luxury buses (2025 model) with bathroom for Mashaer days (Mina-Arafat-Muzdalifah)', 'Makkah - Madinah transfer by high-speed train', 'Ziyarat in Madinah with guidance', 'Hajj training & guidance in Pakistan / Saudi Arabia', 'Religious guide book', 'Assistance with Qurbani & Tawaf-e-Ziyara', 'Mic & speaker for religious guidance in Mina & Arafat'], ARRAY['Airline ticket (approx PKR 335,000 from Karachi / PKR 345,000 from North Pakistan; international fares vary)', 'Qurbani (approx SAR 720 per person)', 'Personal expenses & anything not listed under inclusions', 'Optional upgrades & supplements (listed separately below)'], ARRAY['Super Deluxe tent — private toilet, 06 to a tent (+ SAR 40,000 per person)', 'Deluxe tent — private toilet, 08 to a tent (+ SAR 16,000 per person)', 'Diamond tent — 12 to a tent (+ SAR 6,000 per person)', 'Aziziya family rooms for the 5 days of Hajj (+ SAR 20,000)', 'Additional Madinah nights — Double SAR 3,000 / Triple SAR 2,200 / Quad SAR 2,190 per night per person', 'VIP GMC transport for the 5 days of Hajj (SAR 35,000 per vehicle, up to 6 persons)', 'Upgrade international flight to Business class (subject to availability)', 'Family / Private car — Jeddah airport to Makkah hotel & back (SAR 600 per person)', 'Family / Private car — Madinah airport to Madinah hotel & back (SAR 150 per person)'], ARRAY['Rooms are retained 25–28 May (the 5 days of Hajj) in the Makkah accommodation.', 'The number of nights in Makkah may be reduced; the package price stays the same.', 'During peak days (1–14 Zil Hajj) hotel check-in is after Isha prayers and check-out is at 12 PM.', 'A family tent in Mina with private toilet is available on request.', 'Prices, hotels and packages are subject to change — including after booking, per Saudi Talimaat.'], '{}', 'active', true);

